WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.383 --> 00:00:03.350
Unit eleven. Drug Use and Harm!

2
00:00:04.330 --> 00:00:09.700
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Sokha, your school doctor.

3
00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:12.829
Hi, Doctor Sokha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:17.152
Today we learn about Drug Use and Harm. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.001 --> 00:00:21.668
Drugs. Say it with me. Drugs!

6
00:00:25.213 --> 00:00:29.113
Addiction. Say it with me. Addiction!

7
00:00:32.621 --> 00:00:36.822
Overdose. Say it with me. Overdose!

8
00:00:40.281 --> 00:00:44.114
Mental health. Say it with me. Mental health!

9
00:00:47.624 --> 00:00:51.624
Mixing. Say it with me. Mixing!

10
00:00:55.133 --> 00:00:58.833
Risk. Say it with me. Risk!

11
00:01:02.297 --> 00:01:05.680
Help. Say it with me. Help!

12
00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:13.266
Recovery. Say it with me. Recovery!

13
00:01:16.763 --> 00:01:26.502
Drug use can lead to addiction, overdose, and mental health problems. Mixing substances increases risk. Getting help early supports recovery.

14
00:01:26.552 --> 00:01:29.833
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Sokha!

15
00:01:30.770 --> 00:01:36.077
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:36.127 --> 00:01:37.277
Overdose!

17
00:01:38.384 --> 00:01:43.760
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:43.810 --> 00:01:44.960
Help!

19
00:01:45.803 --> 00:01:52.199
Did you know? Addiction is a health condition, and treatment and support can help people recover!

20
00:01:52.249 --> 00:01:54.494
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:55.693 --> 00:02:04.154
Think and answer. Why is mixing substances especially dangerous?

22
00:02:04.204 --> 00:02:05.354
Great answer!

23
00:02:06.330 --> 00:02:11.924
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:11.974 --> 00:02:14.816
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

